<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Operations — {{ app_name }}</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_elang/assets/ui.css?v={{ elang_asset_version }}"></head><body><header class="product-header"><a class="product-brand" href="/">{{ app_name }}</a><nav><a href="/dashboard">Account</a><a href="/security">Security</a></nav></header><main class="wide-shell"><p class="eyebrow">ADMINISTRATOR / OPERATIONS</p><h1>Application health.</h1><p>HTTP totals cover the last hour. Worker heartbeats older than 120 seconds need attention. Long jobs need a suitable heartbeat policy.</p><section class="panel"><h2>Queue</h2><p><span>Queued</span>: {{ snapshot.queues.queued }} · <span>Reserved</span>: {{ snapshot.queues.reserved }} · <span>Failed</span>: {{ snapshot.queues.failed }} · <span>Outbox pending</span>: {{ snapshot.outbox_pending }}</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Workers</h2>{% for worker in snapshot.workers %}<p>{{ worker.kind }} · {{ worker.id }} · {{ worker.healthy ? 'Recent heartbeat' : 'Stale heartbeat' }} · {{ worker.processed }} <span>attempts</span></p>{% else %}<p>No recent worker heartbeat. Start a supervised queue:work process.</p>{% endfor %}</section><section class="panel"><h2>HTTP requests</h2>{% for row in snapshot.http %}<p>{{ row.route_name }} — {{ row.requests }} <span>requests</span> · {{ row.errors }} <span>server errors</span> · <span>mean</span> {{ (row.duration_ms / row.requests)|round(1) }} <span>ms</span> · <span>max</span> {{ row.max_ms }} <span>ms</span></p>{% else %}<p>Enable operations collection to see request totals.</p>{% endfor %}</section><section class="panel"><h2>Failed jobs</h2><p>Review side effects before retrying. Delivery is at least once; handlers must be idempotent.</p>{% for job in snapshot.failed_jobs %}<article><h3>{{ job.name }}</h3><p>{{ job.id }} · {{ job.attempts }} <span>attempts</span> · {{ job.last_error }}</p><form method="post" action="/operations/jobs/{{ job.id }}/retry"><input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ token }}"><button>Retry reviewed job</button></form></article>{% else %}<p>No failed jobs.</p>{% endfor %}</section></main></body></html>
